==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

